## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Test Method | Smell | Effort |
|----------|-------------|-------|--------|
| 1 | `addAndDoNothing` | Assertion-Free | Trivial — add one assertion |
| 2 | `addNullSkuManualCatch` | Exception Handling | Low — replace with `assertThrows` |
| 3 | `addSleepy` | Sleepy Test | Trivial — delete `Thread.sleep` |
| 4 | `addLoadsFromFile` | Mystery Guest | Low — inline test data |
| 5 | `addConditionalLogic` | Conditional Logic | Low — inline calls |
| 6 | `doEverythingAtOnce` | Eager Test | Medium — split into 3 tests |
| 7 | `quantityAfterAdds` | Magic Number | Low — name the constants |
| 8 | `toStringFormat` | Sensitive Equality | Low — assert semantics |
| 9 | `setUp` / `rng` field | General Fixture | Trivial — delete field |
| 10 | `disabledTest` | Ignored Test | Trivial — re-enable or delete |

Tackle items 1–5 first — they carry the highest risk of false-passes or flakiness and are each a one-line to three-line fix.
